# T21 investigation: a human who does not drive after GO (a child looking at the screen, a player
# who missed GO). In a human-mode run on Toy Town the HUD showed 2nd/8 eight seconds after GO with
# six rivals still behind the parked car. Do the rivals get around a car parked on the grid?
# Quick Race on Toy Town, no input after GO; chase and look-back views over 20 s, then drive.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Toy Town (focused): select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait countdown
0.5 shot idle_00_countdown
wait racing
@60 shot idle_01_1s
@180 shot idle_02_3s
@200 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@230 shot idle_03_3s_back
@240 hold keyboardA lookBack 0
@480 shot idle_04_8s
@500 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@530 shot idle_05_8s_back
@540 hold keyboardA lookBack 0
@900 shot idle_06_15s
@920 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@950 shot idle_07_15s_back
@960 hold keyboardA lookBack 0
@1200 shot idle_08_20s
@1220 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@1250 shot idle_09_20s_back
@1260 hold keyboardA lookBack 0
@1270 hold keyboardA throttle 1
@1500 shot idle_10_25s_driving
@1510 release keyboardA
1.0 exit
